---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE } from '../config/site';
---

<Base
  title="Terms of Service | SAPVIK"
  description="Terms of Service governing digital growth advisory, development, promotions, and consulting agreements with SAPVIK."
>
  <div class="legal-page section">
    <div class="container legal-container">
      <div class="legal-head">
        <span class="mono-label">Legal Agreement</span>
        <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Engagement</h1>
        <p class="mono-label" style="color: var(--c-text-muted);">Last Updated: October 2026</p>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-body framed-card">
        <section class="legal-sec">
          <h2>1. Scope of Advisory & Delivery</h2>
          <p>
            {SITE.brand.name} provides digital growth partnerships covering website development, Google Business Profile management, performance advertising, custom application development, media management, and brand identity systems. All project milestones, deliverables, and commercial fees are defined in individual statements of work (SOWs).
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-sec">
          <h2>2. Performance Projections vs. Commercial Guarantees</h2>
          <p>
            While {SITE.brand.name} implements rigorous technical optimization and engineering discipline, external search engine rankings (Google SEO and GMB) and third-party advertising algorithms (Google Ads, Meta) are governed by autonomous external platforms. All estimates generated by our illustrative simulator or preliminary discovery audits represent directional projections based on stated benchmarks and are not contractual revenue guarantees.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-sec" id="asset-ownership">
          <h2>3. Intellectual Property & Direct Asset Ownership</h2>
          <p>
            Upon full settlement of contracted invoices, all bespoke source code, visual creative assets, custom branding vectors, and advertising accounts created specifically for the client become the exclusive property of the client. Zero proprietary agency lock-in.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-sec" id="ad-billing">
          <h2>4. Direct Ad Media Billing</h2>
          <p>
            All media expenditure on Google Ads, Meta Ads, or third-party networks is billed directly by the platform to the client's corporate payment instrument without hidden agency percentages.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-sec" id="onboarding-sla">
          <h2>5. Discovery Turnaround SLA (&lt;24h)</h2>
          <p>
            {SITE.brand.name} commits to an initial technical review and growth audit response for submitted business inquiries within 24 business hours.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="legal-sec">
          <h2>6. Governing Law</h2>
          <p>
            These terms are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of India. Any disputes arising in connection with services shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the competent courts in India.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Base>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding-top: calc(var(--header-h) + 2.5rem);
    padding-bottom: clamp(3.5rem, 6vw, 5rem);
  }
  .legal-container {
    max-width: 840px;
  }
  .legal-head {
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }
  .legal-title {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .legal-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 2rem;
    line-height: 1.7;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }
  .legal-sec h2 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }
  .legal-sec p {
    color: var(--c-text-secondary);
  }
</style>
